@set kindness = 0
An old man asks you for some food. Do you [[share your bread]](child, kindness += 1) or [[walk on]](child)?

[[child]]:
A lost child is crying by the road. Do you [[help her find her way]](final, kindness += 1) or [[ignore her]](final)?

[[final]]:
{{#if kindness = 2}}{{goto "hero"}}{{else if kindness = 1}}{{goto "traveller"}}{{else}}{{goto "stranger"}}{{/if}}

[[hero]]:
@end
Word of your kindness spreads, and you're welcomed in every village you pass through.

[[traveller]]:
@end
You carry on your way, a little wiser.

[[stranger]]:
@end
You reach the city alone, and nobody knows your name.
